          {
            "title": "Customize a collection",
            "id": 152139,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>APIs públicas geralmente retornam coleções grandes, enquanto um aplicativo pode precisar apenas dos itens que correspondem a uma única escolha.</p><p>Os parâmetros de consulta permitem que uma requisição descreva essa escolha. Você vai aprender a adicioná-los a URLs e a requisições do Python.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 2, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;JavaScript&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 3, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;HTML&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Start a query string",
            "id": 152140,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um ponto de interrogação inicia uma string de consulta após o endpoint. O nome do parâmetro vem em seguida.</p><p>Esta API usa <code>id</code> para identificar cursos. Adicione o ponto de interrogação e o nome do parâmetro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>?</code> seguido de <code>id</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add a parameter value",
            "id": 152141,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um sinal de igual conecta o nome do parâmetro ao seu valor.</p><p>Adicione o valor <code>1</code> para solicitar o curso com o id <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code> seguido de <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um sinal de igual conecta o nome do parâmetro ao seu valor.</p><p>Crie a string de consulta para solicitar o curso com <code>id</code> igual a <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>?</code> seguido de <code>id</code>, <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Use different value types",
            "id": 152142,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os valores dos parâmetros podem identificar itens com números, como <code>1</code>, ou corresponder a textos, como o nome de um curso.</p><p>Complete o valor da string que solicita o curso <code>Python</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"parameter_values.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"string_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?name=Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os valores dos parâmetros podem identificar itens com números, como <code>1</code>, ou corresponder a textos, como o nome de um curso.</p><p>Esta API usa <code>id</code> para IDs numéricos e <code>name</code> para nomes de cursos.</p><p>Solicite o ID <code>1</code> em <code>number_url</code> e o curso <code>Python</code> em <code>string_url</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"parameter_values.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"string_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?name=Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"course\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>id</code> seguido de <code>name</code> e finalmente <code>Python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose another post",
            "id": 152143,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Peça à API o curso com o ID <code>3</code> digitando o nome do parâmetro de consulta <code>id</code>, depois um sinal de igual <code>=</code> e, por fim, o número <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"comment_feed.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 3, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;HTML&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>id=3</code>.</p></body></html>"
