            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual URL solicita dados da API para um usuário com ID <code>4</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/courses?userId=4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esta API filtra usuários com o parâmetro <code>userId</code>.</p><p>Qual URL solicita dados da API para um usuário com ID <code>4</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/courses?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?id=4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code>.</p></body></html>",
