          {
            "title": "A More Focused Request",
            "id": 152218,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Já sabemos que podemos usar um parâmetro de consulta como filtro. Vamos ver como podemos combinar vários filtros para obter um resultado ainda melhor.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the First Parameter",
            "id": 152219,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Antes de começarmos a combinar várias strings de consulta, vamos primeiro criar uma URL com uma delas.</p><p>Crie uma string de consulta para filtrar cursos por idioma.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>?</code> seguido de <code>language</code> e depois <code>=</code>, <code>python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Make Room for Another",
            "id": 152220,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um e comercial <code>&amp;</code> separa um parâmetro de consulta do próximo.</p><p>Adicione <code>&amp;</code> depois do parâmetro de idioma para abrir espaço para outro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Second Parameter",
            "id": 152221,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O segundo parâmetro vem depois do \"e\" comercial sem outro ponto de interrogação.</p><p>Adicione <code>level=beginner</code> para solicitar cursos para iniciantes.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>level</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O segundo parâmetro vem depois do \"e\" comercial sem outro ponto de interrogação.</p><p>Mantenha o filtro de linguagem e adicione o filtro <code>level</code> com o valor <code>beginner</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"language\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"python\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&amp;</code> seguido de <code>level</code>, <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Second Parameter - Copy",
            "id": 152240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se usarmos <code>&amp;</code> para combinar vários parâmetros de consulta, todos serão usados na consulta, desde que a API seja compatível com eles.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se usarmos <code>&amp;</code> para combinar vários parâmetros de consulta, todos serão usados na consulta, desde que a API seja compatível com eles.</p><p>Solicite cursos de Python para iniciantes, mantendo <code>language</code> primeiro e <code>level</code> depois.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"advanced\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"javascript\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>?</code> seguido de <code>python</code>, <code>&amp;</code> e finalmente <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Send the Combined Request",
            "id": 152222,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A URL concluída agora contém os dois filtros do curso.</p><p>Passe <code>url</code> para <code>requests.get()</code> para enviar a solicitação combinada.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>requests</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>get</code>, <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A URL concluída agora contém os dois filtros do curso.</p><p>Busque cursos que correspondam aos dois filtros e depois analise a resposta como JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>requests</code> seguido de <code>get</code>, <code>url</code>, <code>response</code> e finalmente <code>json</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
